Description: Public transport journey planner and timetable
 Fahrplan plans journeys and shows departure boards for public transport
 in many countries of Europe, in Australia and worldwide (Transitous).
 .
 Backends: Deutsche Bahn, OBB (Austria), Salzburg, Munich (MVV), VRR (Rhine
 Ruhr), search.ch (Switzerland), Rejseplanen (Denmark), reiseinfo.no (Norway),
 Vasttrafik and ResRobot (Sweden), matka.fi (Finland), 9292 (the Netherlands),
 Transport for Ireland, Sydney, Victoria and Transitous (worldwide, built
 from open GTFS feeds).
 .
 This is the Maemo Leste port of Fahrplan 2, with the stacked windows,
 picker buttons and application menu of the Fahrplan that Maemo 5 had.
XSBC-Maemo-Display-Name: Fahrplan
